KrishiMitra (AgriNexus) — Android app placeholder.

This file is NOT a working APK yet. Replace this file with your signed
release build (keep the same filename) and the navbar download button
will serve it directly:

    android/  ->  assembleRelease output .apk  ->  public/downloads/KrishiMitra.apk

Better long-term option: attach the .apk to a GitHub Release
(Releases -> Draft a new release -> attach APK -> publish).
The download button automatically prefers the APK asset from the
latest GitHub release whenever one exists, so you never have to
touch the website again.
